            {
                "entry_id": "63dc3de1-d236-374e-83fb-6cd5c6d0c493",
                "word": "masculiniste",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9de33fd4-4a0d-4c48-8696-c8e6a567b56d",
                        "entry_id": "63dc3de1-d236-374e-83fb-6cd5c6d0c493",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "masculinistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b370f09c-882c-3099-a541-6e09be2bf030",
                        "entry_id": "63dc3de1-d236-374e-83fb-6cd5c6d0c493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit de quelqu’un ou quelque chose partisan du masculinisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3a8adb6-4049-4f76-82d3-50167ff692b3",
                                "sense_id": "b370f09c-882c-3099-a541-6e09be2bf030",
                                "text": "Dans un cycle vicieux, il développe une anthropologie théologique qui souligne la distance entre le masculin et le féminin afin de soutenir une christologie masculiniste et il fait appel à un langage symbolique où le féminin s’attache davantage à la Vierge Marie qu’à son fils."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf7eddd7-48fa-4373-ae4d-84edac1227e0",
                                "sense_id": "b370f09c-882c-3099-a541-6e09be2bf030",
                                "text": "Le discours masculiniste circule d’un pays à l’autre : plusieurs pages dénoncent le triomphe du féminisme radical, du multiculturalisme et de la féminisation de l’homme occidental dans le manifeste de l’assassin d’Oslo, Anders Behring Breivik […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c219dd6c-cb6d-42f9-b3a2-5ae488698727",
                                "sense_id": "b370f09c-882c-3099-a541-6e09be2bf030",
                                "text": "Les performances des Hommen lors de la Manif pour tous avaient déjà mis en évidence la tension qui pouvait émerger de cette affirmation masculiniste chez des catholiques pris entre une masculinité domestiquée et une tentation viriliste, au risque de basculer vers un modèle populaire trop fondé sur le capital corporel brut, ou, en mettant en avant le culte du corps masculin, vers des modèles issus des subcultures gaies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39752f69-9621-4eae-aac9-09a0a4a31a70",
                        "source_entry_id": "63dc3de1-d236-374e-83fb-6cd5c6d0c493",
                        "source_sense_id": "b370f09c-882c-3099-a541-6e09be2bf030",
                        "target_lang_word": "masculinist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "masculinist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c07b0c6-0745-3450-871c-5ba5a43b3f85",
                                        "entry_id": "c1a5a257-770a-3356-a941-7ead62bcbfae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to or in accordance with masculinism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "438603be-1abe-41ab-9989-ac1374baab43",
                                                "sense_id": "9c07b0c6-0745-3450-871c-5ba5a43b3f85",
                                                "text": "We live in a masculinist-oriented (as opposed to a feminist-oriented) society. That is, we live in a society which rewards masculine action, even if such action is taken by a woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea021600-395b-4485-ad68-566fff2db690",
                                                "sense_id": "9c07b0c6-0745-3450-871c-5ba5a43b3f85",
                                                "text": "But evolutionary psychology, as it has been disseminated across mainstream consciousness, is a cranky and despotic Cyclops, its single eye glaring through an overwhelmingly masculinist lens. I say \"masculinist\" rather than male because the view of male behaviour promulgated by hard-core evolutionary psychologists is as narrow and inflexible as their view of womanhood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75c34e4c-d0c8-4239-830c-a38dde8aa87f",
                                                "sense_id": "9c07b0c6-0745-3450-871c-5ba5a43b3f85",
                                                "text": "This includes research that examines the role that adolescent \"tinkering\" plays in developing mechanical interests and aptitudes; male and female patterns of participation in Internet-based communications; the prevalence of masculinist \"search and destroy\" narratives in video and computer games; the masculine subcultures of computing, including the close links between technophilia and technoporn; and the cultivation of gendered differences in consumer desire in technomarketing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "masculinist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50f8fef6-108b-30c6-b47a-b4af234e0ecb",
                                        "entry_id": "992ea6ce-fd0e-3d3c-9f91-0ae54002b078",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of masculinism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
